0_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl04_bannerImgBig class=img_big fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202211251433530.jpeg style=border-width:0><img id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl04_bannerImgSmall class=img_small fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202211251433530.jpeg style=border-width:0></a></div><div id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl05_bannerItem class=item style="background-image:url('/upload/banner/202204082117410.jpeg')"><a id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl05_bannerlink href=https://www.facebook.com/QingZhiXin><img id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl05_bannerImgBig class=img_big fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202204082117410.jpeg style=border-width:0><img id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl05_bannerImgSmall class=img_small fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202204082117411.jpeg style=border-width:0></a></div><div id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl06_bannerItem class=item style="background-image:url('/upload/banner/202606282130410.jpeg')"><a id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl06_bannerlink><img id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl06_bannerImgBig class=img_big fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202606282130410.jpeg style=border-width:0><img id=ctl00_banner_holder_banner_bannerRepeater_ctl06_bannerImgSmall class=img_small fetchpriority=low alt="" loading=lazy decoding=async src=../../upload/banner/202606282130410.jpeg style=border-width:0></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=header_ex></div><div class="wrp-deco bottom"></div><div class="wrp-deco avatar"></div></header><div class=main><div class=main_top></div><div class=main_content><div class=container><div class=row><aside id=ctl00_side1 class="side side1 hidden-lg hidden-md hidden-sm hidden-xs"><div class="wrp-deco top"></div><button type=button class="btn side-toggle collapsed" data-toggle=collapse data-target=#side1collapse aria-expanded=false aria-controls=side1collapse> <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-list" aria-hidden=true></span> 次選單 <span class=toggle-icon> <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-down"></span> <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-up"></span> </span> </button><div class=collapse id=side1collapse></div><div class="wrp-deco bottom"></div></aside><main id=ctl00_content class="content col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12"><ol class="breadcrumb hidden-xs"></ol><h2 class=h2><span class=txt-en>NEWS</span><span class=txt-tw>最新消息</span></h2><h1 class=h1><small> 2026/02/01</small> 林建南-南爸One 議員初選總部成立 陳亭妃、王定宇雙站台</h1><div class=eZShareBar><div class="shareList hidden-print"><a class="fb item" href="javascript:shareTo('fb')"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a> <a class="twitter item" href="javascript:shareTo('twitter')"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a> <a class="line item" href="javascript:shareTo('line')"><i class="fab fa-line"></i></a> <a class="mial item isToggle" href="javascript:shareTo('mial')"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i></a> <button class="link item isToggle" type=button data-clipboard-text="https://www.cnma.org.tw/page/news/show.aspx?lang=TW&amp;num=49860"><i class="fas fa-link"></i></button> <a class="add item" href=javascript:toggle()> <i class="fas fa-plus icona"></i> <i class="fas fa-minus iconm"></i> </a></div></div><style>.eZShareBar .shareList{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}.eZShareBar .item{width:33px;height:33px;background:#ddd;font-size:23px;color:#fff;border:none;outline:none;box-shadow:none;margin:2px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}.eZShareBar .item.add.open .iconm,.eZShareBar .item.add .icona{display:block}.eZShareBar .item.add.open .icona,.eZShareBar .item.add .iconm{display:none}.eZShareBar .item:hover{opacity:0.8}.eZShareBar .item.isToggle{display:none}.eZShareBar .item.isToggle.open{display:flex}.eZShareBar .item.fb{background:#4267b2}.eZShareBar .item.twitter{background:#1da1f2}.eZShareBar .item.line{background:#1bb71f}.eZShareBar .item.pinterest{background:#bd081c}.eZShareBar .item.mial{background:#666}.eZShareBar .item.print{background:#444}.eZShareBar .item.link{background:#555}</style><script src=https://www.cnma.org.tw/js/clipboard.js-master/dist/clipboard.min.js></script><script>var thisUrl="https://www.cnma.org.tw/page/news/show.aspx?lang=TW&num=49860";var windowSize="height=500,width=600"
var thisTitle=document.title;var clipboard=new Clipboard('.eZShareBar .link');clipboard.on('success',function(e){alert("Copy: "+e.text);e.clearSelection();});function shareTo(target){switch(target){case"fb":window.open('http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u='.concat(encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)),'',config=windowSize);break;case"twitter":window.open('https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text='.concat(encodeURIComponent(document.title))+'&url='.concat(encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)),'',config=windowSize);break;case"line":window.open('https://lineit.line.me/share/ui?url='+encodeURIComponent(thisUrl)+'&text='+encodeURIComponent(document.title),'_blank',config=windowSize);break;case"mial":window.location="mailto:?subject="+thisTitle+"&body="+thisTitle+thisUrl,'',config=windowSize;break;case"print":window.print();break;}}
function toggle(){$(".eZShareBar .isToggle").toggleClass("open");$(".eZShareBar .item.add").toggleClass("open");}</script><div class="txt editor"><span style=font-size:24px>記者黃冠源/台南報導 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;台南市市議員初選參選人林建南，(31日)於北區西門路四段成立初選競選總部，投入民進黨第八選區(中西、北區）議員初選，民進黨提名台南市長候選人陳亭妃，立委王定宇、議員及各局處長官都到場相挺，各大社團、公協會及在地里長、鄉親眾多支持者都至現場共襄盛舉，為林建南加油打氣。<img alt="" src=https://www.cnma.org.tw/upload/web/138124.jpg><br> 林建南表示，民進黨初選台南市第八選區市議員黨內初選相當激烈，有現任市議員陳怡珍、議長邱莉莉、周嘉韋、沈震東的弟弟沈震南出馬參選，林建南自己則是第二度挑戰，共五位參選人，民進黨部預計提名四席，因此林建南在12月底辭掉台南市政府社會局機要秘書一職，就是要在北區、中西區力拼提名，期盼在三月份民進黨電話民調中順利勝出，並在年底大選全力以赴。<br> 林建南更表示，他曾任王定宇服務處副主任，加上多年來於市府社會局的歷練，長期投入基層事務，對社會福利、弱勢關懷與公共行政運作相當熟悉。他表示，正是因為服務期間接觸到許多基層家庭的困境與需求，讓他對於社會弱勢更加重視，更加堅定他投入地方政治、爭取改善市民生活品質的決心。林建南說，他已經準備好了，決心打造更好的大台南，讓城市一天比一天更好，他拜託台南市北區、中西區的市民接到民調電話請跟民調公司說唯一支持林建南。<img alt="" src=https://www.cnma.org.tw/upload/web/138114(1).jpg><br> 民進黨提名台南市長參選人陳亭妃表示，感謝台南市民的支持，讓她初選過關， 同樣的林建南也是需要選民的支持，因為民進黨的選舉初選是最堅難的，如果沒有拿到入門票是無法進入到第二關當候選人，肔自己用剛初選過關的心情，來向林建南加油，尤其民進黨在初選登記開始到民調只有一個多月的時間，時間非常短暫，所以她拜託眾多好朋友，跟周邊的好朋友講，接到電話民調一定要支持林建南，因為每一通民調電話都代表著是否能夠擔任市議員候選人。<br> &nbsp;<img alt="" src=https://www.cnma.org.tw/upload/web/138113.jpg></span></div><div class=btn-box><ul class=pager><li><a id=ctl00_content_holder_goback href="index.aspx?lang=TW"><span class="icon icon-back"></span>回列表頁</a></ul></div></main><aside id=ctl00_side2 class="side side2 hidden-lg hidden-md hidden-sm hidden-xs"><div class="wrp-deco top"></div><div class="wrp-deco bottom"></div></aside></div><div id=floating class=isToggle><a href=# class=btn-floating><span class="icon icon-arrow"></span></a><ul class=list-unstyled><li class=cart><a href=https://www.cnma.org.tw/page/cart/index.aspx><i class="icon fas fa-shopping-cart"></i>購物車<span id=ctl00__floating_shopCount class=num>0</span></a><li class=member><a id=ctl00__floating_floatingLink02a href=../member/login.aspx><i class="icon fas fa-user"></i>會員登入</a><li class=help><a href=https://www.cnma.org.tw/page/cart/help.aspx><i class="icon fas fa-question-circle">